1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,536
Good morning, everyone,

2
00:00:03,536 --> 00:00:09,000
and welcome to Stevenson's, one of the country's major manufacturers of metal goods.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,830
Thank you for choosing us for your two weeks of work experience.

4
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:14,859
My name is Julia Simmons,

5
00:00:14,859 --> 00:00:19,500
and since the beginning of this year I've been the managing director.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,600
Stevenson's is quite an old company.

7
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:28,859
Like me, the founder, Ronald Stevenson, went into the steel industry when he left

8
00:00:28,859 --> 00:00:31,930
school – that was in 1923.

9
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:38,247
He set up this company when he finished his apprenticeship, in 1926, although he

10
00:00:38,247 --> 00:00:43,320
actually started making plans two years earlier, in 1924.

11
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:45,750
He was a very determined young man!

12
00:00:45,750 --> 00:00:53,031
Stevenson's long-term plan was to manufacture components for the machine tools industry – although

13
00:00:53,031 --> 00:00:56,421
in fact that never came about – and for the automotive industry,

14
00:00:56,421 --> 00:00:59,490
that is, cars and lorries.

15
00:00:59,490 --> 00:01:04,437
However, there was a delay of five years before that happened,

16
00:01:04,437 --> 00:01:12,530
because shortly before the company went into production, Stevenson was given the opportunity to make goods for hospitals

17
00:01:12,530 --> 00:01:15,775
and other players in the healthcare industry,

18
00:01:15,775 --> 00:01:19,340
so that's what we did for the first five years.

19
00:01:19,340 --> 00:01:25,521
Over the years, we've expanded the premises considerably – we were lucky that the

20
00:01:25,521 --> 00:01:26,424
site is big enough,

21
00:01:26,424 --> 00:01:31,120
so moving to a new location has never been necessary.

22
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:36,854
However, the layout is far from ideal for modern machinery and production methods,

23
00:01:36,854 --> 00:01:42,007
so we intend to carry out major refurbishment of this site over the next

24
00:01:42,007 --> 00:01:43,130
five years.

25
00:01:43,130 --> 00:01:48,870
I'd better give you some idea of what you'll be doing during your two

26
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:49,752
weeks with us,

27
00:01:49,752 --> 00:01:51,960
so you know what to expect.

28
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:57,480
Most mornings you'll have a presentation from one of the managers, to learn about

29
00:01:57,480 --> 00:02:02,920
their department, starting this morning with research and development.

30
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:08,114
And you'll all spend some time in each department, observing what's going on

31
00:02:08,114 --> 00:02:11,824
and talking to people – as long as you don't stop them from doing

32
00:02:11,824 --> 00:02:13,870
their work altogether!

33
00:02:13,870 --> 00:02:18,302
In the past, a teacher from your school has come in at the end

34
00:02:18,302 --> 00:02:21,712
of each week to find out how the group were getting on,

35
00:02:21,712 --> 00:02:28,370
but your school isn't able to arrange that this year.

36
00:02:28,370 --> 00:02:34,100
OK, now I'll briefly help you to orientate yourselves around the site.

37
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:37,433
As you can see, we're in the reception area,

38
00:02:37,433 --> 00:02:41,730
which we try to make attractive and welcoming to visitors.

39
00:02:41,730 --> 00:02:44,743
There's a corridor running left from here,

40
00:02:44,743 --> 00:02:49,442
and if you go along that, the door facing you at the end is

41
00:02:49,442 --> 00:02:51,230
the entrance to the coffee room.

42
00:02:51,230 --> 00:02:54,542
This looks out onto the main road on one side,

43
00:02:54,542 --> 00:02:56,208
and some trees on the other,

44
00:02:56,208 --> 00:02:59,480
and that'll be where you meet each morning.

45
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:05,290
The factory is the very big room on the far side of the site.

46
00:03:05,290 --> 00:03:07,699
Next to it is the warehouse,

47
00:03:07,699 --> 00:03:12,117
which can be accessed by lorries going up the road to the turning area

48
00:03:12,117 --> 00:03:13,000
at the end.

49
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:17,181
You can get to the warehouse by crossing to the far side of the

50
00:03:17,181 --> 00:03:17,844
courtyard,

51
00:03:17,844 --> 00:03:21,000
and then the door is on your right.

52
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:25,000
Somewhere you'll be keen to find is the staff canteen.

53
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,700
This is right next to reception.

54
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:30,938
I can confidently say that the food's very good,

55
00:03:30,938 --> 00:03:33,110
but the view isn't.

56
00:03:33,110 --> 00:03:36,739
The windows on one side look onto a corridor and courtyard,

57
00:03:36,739 --> 00:03:39,186
which aren't very attractive at all,

58
00:03:39,186 --> 00:03:42,153
and on the other onto the access road,

59
00:03:42,153 --> 00:03:44,720
which isn't much better.

60
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:48,549
You'll be using the meeting room quite often,

61
00:03:48,549 --> 00:03:53,020
and you'll find it by walking along the corridor to the left of the

62
00:03:53,020 --> 00:03:53,722
courtyard,

63
00:03:53,722 --> 00:03:57,110
and continuing along it to the end.

64
00:03:57,110 --> 00:04:00,483
The meeting room is the last one on the right,

65
00:04:00,483 --> 00:04:04,700
and I'm afraid there's no natural daylight in the room.

66
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:09,060
Then you'll need to know where some of the offices are.

67
00:04:09,060 --> 00:04:13,455
The human resources department is at the front of this building,

68
00:04:13,455 --> 00:04:17,489
so you head to the left along the corridor from reception,

69
00:04:17,489 --> 00:04:20,500
and it's the second room you come to.

70
00:04:20,500 --> 00:04:22,800
It looks out onto the mainroad.

71
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:27,490
And finally, the boardroom, where you'll be meeting sometimes.

72
00:04:27,490 --> 00:04:31,940
That has quite a pleasant view, as it looks out on to the trees.

73
00:04:31,940 --> 00:04:36,260
Go along the corridor past the courtyard, right to the end.

74
00:04:36,260 --> 00:04:40,050
The boardroom is on the left, next to the factory.

75
00:04:40,050 --> 00:04:44,000
OK, now are there any questions before we …
